<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators</RootNamespace>

    <Title>Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators — 技術指標函式庫(批次 + 增量)</Title>
    <Description>零相依的 .NET 技術指標函式庫,每個指標同時提供「批次計算」與「增量(streaming)計算」兩種版本:SMA、EMA、RSI、ATR、MACD、Bollinger Bands、Donchian Channel、ADX(含 +DI/-DI)。增量版每根 K 線只更新常數量的內部狀態,記憶體用量與已處理筆數無關,適合長時間執行的即時交易引擎;暖身期未滿時明確回傳 null 而非 0。全部以 decimal 運算(含自研 decimal 牛頓法平方根),不使用 double/float。Zero-dependency .NET technical analysis library providing both batch and O(1)-memory streaming implementations of SMA, EMA, RSI, ATR, MACD, Bollinger Bands, Donchian Channel and ADX. All math in decimal; explicit warm-up semantics (null until ready).</Description>
    <PackageTags>ozakboy;technical-analysis;technical-indicators;trading;sma;ema;rsi;atr;macd;bollinger-bands;donchian-channel;adx;wilder;streaming;incremental;realtime;online-algorithm;decimal;ohlcv;candlestick;zero-dependency;dotnet;csharp</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.1.1 — Package icon: the shared ozakboy brand mark now shows on nuget.org and in IDE package managers. No code changed; NuGet package metadata cannot be altered on an already-published version, so refreshing the icon requires a new one. 0.1.0 — Initial release. Eight technical indicators, each with a batch implementation and a constant-memory streaming implementation that produce identical results: SMA, EMA (with a selectable seeding convention via EmaSeedMode), RSI and ATR (Wilder smoothing), MACD (signal line and histogram), Bollinger Bands (configurable standard deviation multiplier), Donchian Channel, and ADX (+DI and -DI). IIndicator and IIndicator&lt;TInput, TOutput&gt; drive, warm-up check and reset a heterogeneous set of streaming indicators uniformly. Candle is an immutable OHLCV readonly record struct with Candle.Of for timestamp-free construction. DecimalMath.Sqrt is a Newton–Raphson square root for decimal, and DecimalMath.TryDivide handles the zero-denominator cases live markets produce. Warm-up is explicit: every indicator returns null rather than 0 or an undefined value until it holds enough data, and reports readiness through IsReady and WarmupPeriod. All arithmetic is decimal; double and float are not used anywhere. RSI on a completely flat window returns 100, a deliberate choice matching most technical-analysis libraries. Targets net10.0 with no PackageReference at all. Bilingual (Traditional Chinese and English) XML documentation on every public member. Full notes: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.TradeKit.Indicators/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <GenerateDocumentationFile>true</GenerateDocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!--
    刻意不引用 Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub 套件。
    自 .NET 8 起 SourceLink 已內建於 SDK,只要設定 PublishRepositoryUrl 與 EmbedUntrackedSources
    (見 Directory.Build.props)即可產生原始碼連結;外掛套件反而會帶進額外的相依鏈,
    其中 Microsoft.Build.Tasks.Git 曾有安全通報(NU1902),在 TreatWarningsAsErrors 之下會讓還原階段直接失敗。
    本套件因此維持零 NuGet 相依。
  -->

</Project>
